<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight and one-week rates on the Egyptian pound rose in the private-sector interbank market on Sunday, bankers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates were 10 1/4 percent against 10 percent on Thursday, when the market is traditionally very liquid.</p>
<p>One-week rates were between 10 3/8 and 10 7/16 percent from 10 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
